@startuml ASignX_System_Architecture
title ASignX - Simplified System Architecture
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ranksep 40
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor White
skinparam rectangleBorderColor Black

rectangle "Users\nGuest, Learner, Administrator" as Users

rectangle "ASignX Web Application\nReact\n\nASignLive | ASign Learn | Sign Strike\nProfile, Progress and Administration" as Web

rectangle "Backend API\nNode.js + Express\n\nAccess control and application logic\nDrizzle ORM for database queries" as API

rectangle "ASL Recognition Service\n(Proposed)\n\nRecognizes static and movement signs\nReturns sign labels and confidence" as AI

rectangle "Supabase\n\nAuth: user accounts\nPostgreSQL: application data\nStorage: demonstrations and model files" as Data

Users -down-> Web : Use application
Web -down-> API : Requests / responses
API -[hidden]down-> AI
AI -[hidden]down-> Data
Web -right-> AI : Camera-derived sequences / predictions
API -left-> Data : Read / write data
Web -left-> Data : Sign-in / media
AI -down-> Data : Load model

footer Proposed architecture | Camera video is not stored
@enduml
